msgid "Obtain the exact source and pinned dependencies"
msgstr "取得精确源码与锁定依赖"

msgid ""
"Use this guide before running repository commands in a tutorial, "
"configuration reference or maintenance workflow. You will obtain a detached,"
" exact Nexus source revision and its recursive dependencies. This requires "
"Git, Python 3.11+ and network access for the initial clone and dependency "
"retrieval. It does not build, flash or establish software or hardware "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"在执行教程、配置参考或维护工作流中的仓库命令前，先使用本指南。你将取得处于 detached 状态的精确 Nexus "
"源码版本及其递归依赖。首次克隆和取得依赖需要 Git、Python 3.11+ 及网络访问。本流程不构建、不刷写，也不建立软件或硬件资格。"

msgid "Select the revision described by your documentation"
msgstr "选择当前文档描述的版本"

msgid ""
"Open the immutable documentation version identified by the page's version "
"banner. Download `documentation-manifest.json` from that version's root, or "
"use the file already present at the root of its verified offline package. "
"Keep it outside your future checkout, for example as `nexus-documentation-"
"manifest.json` in your working parent directory. If you entered through "
"`stable/`, record the resolved immutable version before downloading; do not "
"mix two versions."
msgstr ""
"打开页面版本横幅标识的不可变文档版本。从该版本根目录下载 `documentation-"
"manifest.json`，或使用已验证离线包根目录中的同名文件。将其保存在即将创建的 checkout 外，例如工作父目录下的 `nexus-"
"documentation-manifest.json`。如果从 `stable/` 进入，先记录其选择的不可变版本，再下载；不得混用两个版本。"

msgid "Manifest field"
msgstr "清单字段"

msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

msgid "`documentation_source.commit`"
msgstr "`documentation_source.commit`"

msgid "Exact source containing these pages and their tools"
msgstr "包含这些页面及其工具的精确源码"

msgid "`code_source.commit`"
msgstr "`code_source.commit`"

msgid "Source described by the package; inspect its identity separately"
msgstr "文档包描述的源码；应单独核对其身份"

msgid "`qualification_references[]`"
msgstr "`qualification_references[]`"

msgid "Explicitly verified candidate references in a schema 2 package, each with its original source and scope; may be empty"
msgstr "schema 2 包中显式验证的候选引用，各自保留原源码和范围；可以为空"

msgid "Historical schema 1 packages retain their original `qualified_code.commit` field for read-only recovery. Do not interpret it as a current schema 2 reference."
msgstr "历史 schema 1 包保留原始 `qualified_code.commit` 字段，用于只读恢复。不得将其解释为当前 schema 2 引用。"

msgid ""
"The default GitHub branch may lag a reviewed documentation branch. A branch "
"name, successful clone or documentation release is not a substitute for the "
"exact commit. The previously reviewed documentation snapshot is "
"`5a7a75c321ea173df8692714f95a8df13715293d`; choosing it recreates that "
"snapshot, not later documentation. Its [immutable package "
"manifest](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/versions/docs-20261014-5a7a75c321ea/documentation-"
"manifest.json) is one concrete example. Use your version's manifest for the "
"current tutorial."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 默认分支可能落后于已审查的文档分支。分支名、成功克隆或文档发行都不能替代精确提交。此前已审查的文档快照是 "
"`5a7a75c321ea173df8692714f95a8df13715293d`；选择它只能重建该快照，不能取得后续文档。它的[不可变包清单](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/versions/docs-20261014-5a7a75c321ea/documentation-"
"manifest.json)是一个具体例子。执行当前教程时，使用你所读版本自己的清单。"

msgid "Clone and initialize that exact revision"
msgstr "克隆并初始化该精确版本"

msgid ""
"Run these POSIX-shell commands from the parent directory containing the "
"downloaded manifest. Choose a new checkout directory; the commands do not "
"replace one that already exists. The Python command validates the identity "
"before passing it to Git:"
msgstr ""
"从保存已下载清单的父目录执行以下 POSIX shell 命令。选择新的 checkout 目录；命令不会替换已有目录。Python "
"命令先验证身份，再将其传给 Git："

msgid ""
"Check every command's exit status. `git rev-parse HEAD` must equal the "
"manifest's full commit. Recursive submodule lines must have neither a "
"leading `-` (missing), `+` (different revision) nor `U` (conflict), and `git"
" status --short` must be empty before starting a clean-source workflow. Stop"
" on an unavailable commit or failed dependency retrieval; never substitute "
"`main`, `HEAD` or a latest dependency. For a preview without a package "
"manifest, record the full commit from its source banner or `documentation-"
"build.json` and use that validated commit explicitly."
msgstr ""
"检查每条命令的退出状态。`git rev-parse HEAD` 必须与清单中的完整提交一致。递归子模块输出不能以 `-`（缺失）、`+`（版本不同）或"
" `U`（冲突）开头；开始干净源码工作流前，`git status --short` 必须为空。提交不可取得或依赖取得失败时立即停止，绝不能替换为 "
"`main`、`HEAD` 或最新依赖。没有包清单的预览应从源码横幅或 `documentation-build.json` "
"记录完整提交，并显式使用该已验证提交。"

msgid "Fetching the exact source commit avoids downloading unrelated artifact branches. The `documentation-assets` branch holds large historical evidence archives; it is not a source dependency. Retrieve only an archive identified by the [software evidence entry](../status/software-verification.md) when you need its original raw evidence. A verified Source SDK is another supported consumption path; it does not require the source repository's artifact history."
msgstr "获取精确源码提交可避免下载无关的产物分支。`documentation-assets` 分支存放大型历史证据归档，不是源码依赖。只有需要原始证据时，才按[软件证据入口](../status/software-verification.md)取得其标识的单个归档。经过验证的 Source SDK 是另一条维护的消费路径，不需要源码仓库的产物历史。"

msgid ""
"On Windows, run the POSIX snippet in Git Bash, or read the same manifest "
"field and perform the corresponding Git commands in your shell. Do not treat"
" the shell variable syntax as a portable PowerShell command."
msgstr ""
"Windows 下可在 Git Bash 中执行这段 POSIX 命令，或读取同一清单字段，在自己的 shell 中执行对应 Git "
"命令。不要将这里的变量语法直接当作可移植的 PowerShell 命令。"

