msgid ""
"Each tutorial starts from the repository root established above. Keep "
"independent consumer and package outputs outside the source checkout when "
"instructed. Retain manifests, source identities and required reports before "
"deleting only directories you created. A clean checkout supplies input "
"identity; actual execution and [qualification evidence](../status/software-"
"verification.md) remain separate."
msgstr ""
"每个教程都从上面确定的仓库根目录开始。按要求将独立消费工程和包输出保存在源码 checkout "
"外。删除目录前，保留清单、源码身份及必需报告，并且只删除自己创建的目录。干净 checkout "
"只提供输入身份；实际执行与[资格证据](../status/software-verification.md)仍需分别建立。"
